{"id":"weiter","lemma":"weiter","pos":"adv","rank":154,"glosses":["further, farther, more","on; expresses the continuation of an action"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/De-weiter.ogg/De-weiter.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Es ist nicht viel weiter.","en":"It isn't much further.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757481","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"much, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Sie arbeitete weiter.","en":"She kept working.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394375","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},null]},{"text":"Ich las weiter.","en":"I kept on reading.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69538","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to read","l":"lesen"},null]},{"text":"Weiter kann ich nicht laufen.","en":"I can't walk any further.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to walk"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte nichts weiter zu sagen.","en":"I had nothing else to say.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761084","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]}]}